SUMMARY:Invited Dress Preview: To Kill a Mockingbird 
LOCATION:The Huntington Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Category: The Arts\nPrice: Free\nStatus: You are Confirmed\nEve
 nt URL: https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/205639\n\n6:00PM Reception
  & Gallery Viewing\, 7:00PM Curtain\n\nGo behind the curtain for an exclus
 ive first look at The Huntington Theatre’s To Kill a Mockingbird. The ev
 ening begins with a privae reception in The Maso Studio\, where members wi
 ll enjoy an immersive introduction to the production’s inspiration and e
 xplore key set pieces that bring its world to life. Following the receptio
 n\, members will be guided into the main theatre for a closed final dress 
 rehearsal.\n\nExperience the energy and anticipation of the days leading u
 p to opening night as the cast and creative team refine scenes\, work thro
 ugh director’s notes\, adjust pacing\, revisit line readings\, and put t
 he finishing touches on the performance. It’s an intimate look at the ar
 tistry\, collaboration\, and precision that happen behind the curtain befo
 re the house lights go down.\n\n*This event is complimentary and reserved 
 for members only. Complimentary light bites and beverages will be served. 
 We kindly ask that all cancellations be made at least 24 hours prior to th
 e start of the event.
URL:https://members.thequinhouse.com/events/205639
CATEGORIES:The Arts
